M^2 = \max \left( \sum_{i=1}^{N} B_{ij}^{\ast} B_{ik} \right), \quad \forall j,k
\end{equation}
where $B_{ij}$ are the entries of the matrix in an orthonormal basis. Find $\| \hat{B} \|$.

