A bottle contains 1001 blue balls, 1000 red balls, and 1000 green balls. Additionally, Xiao Ming has enough balls of these three colors. Xiao Ming will repeatedly perform the following operations: each time he will take out two balls from the bottle and then put back one or two balls according to the following rules:

(1) If he takes out one blue ball and one green ball, he puts back one red ball;
(2) If he takes out one red ball and one green ball, he puts back one red ball;
(3) If he takes out two red balls, he puts back two blue balls;
(4) If the two balls taken out are not any of the above three cases, he puts back one green ball.

